 Description
 ~~~~~~~~~~~
 UsEd is an user editor accessory for TechnoBBS. It lists all users in a
 listview gadget, so you can quickly select who to edit. TechUserEd is then
 executed. You can leave UsEd by closing the window or pressing Escape.


